{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99362","id":2183785772,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6CKe0s","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99362","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99362.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99362.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99362","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99362/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99362/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99362/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f0551c659672c852d8fd0f378e5327db826c5c41","number":99362,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add Dialogs to Change Animation Track path","user":{"login":"jasonmorgado","id":21321412,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzIxNDEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21321412?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonmorgado","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonmorgado","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonmorgado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonmorgado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonmorgado/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonmorgado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonmorgado/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonmorgado/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonmorgado/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonmorgado/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonmorgado/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4847\r\n\r\nIn the AnimationPlayer, left clicking the path name allows the user to type in a new path.\r\nThis change adds a right-click menu with the following options:\r\n- Change Target Node - Opens a SceneTreeDialog to select a new node, changing the target node to it\r\n- Change Target Property - Opens a PropertySelector dialog, showing properties on the target node. Selecting one changes the property to that one.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91d80326-41fc-4ba0-9982-2a284ee5dab1)\r\n\r\n\r\nCurrently neither dialog have type filters, I previously considered adding them, but that came with some pain points:\r\n- Two nodes of different types can have the same property, like Sprite2D.modulate and Sprite3D.modulate.\r\n- Tracks don't have types, keyframes have types. So a filter on the property selector didn't seem intuitive.\r\n- The current implementation of changing the path allows the user to pass an incorrect path, putting X's on the keyframes. It might be a good idea to let the user deal with it similarly.\r\n\r\nI'm still somewhat new to the codebase, so it's possible I might've organized some things incorrectly. Although I tried to line things up with how the other menu/dialogs were set up.\r\n\r\nNotably this doesn't add any right click functionality to the group of tracks for the node, that could be an interesting follow up PR.\r\n\r\nI also considered adding a \"Copy to new Target Node\" but getting UndoRedo to work with that + trying to reuse some copy/paste code was a pain. Apparently you can't pass structs like TrackClipboard items into it because they're not variants.🤔 \r\n\r\nSidenote to: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/56074\r\nI notice the right clicking on the keyframes on the left side of the divider, while mousing over a keyframe, still does not register as a keyframe right click. (As an existing issue) This means it will open the menu added in this PR. Not sure if I should make an effort to fix it in this PR or treat it as a separate existing issue.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":